From 4074cfe69df535f4ec669009891cdcf72bb800b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: diamondStar35 <ramymaherali55@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:55:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: mix outgoing and incoming PCM during file cross-fades

Add crossfade-loadfile and the audio-crossfade state map. Retain unplayed outgoing PCM and mix it with incoming audio using linear or equal-power curves. Bound lookahead and retained PCM to 64 MiB each, preserve per-track ReplayGain, and apply volume, mute and transport fades to both sources. Handle short incoming files, interruptions and output-format fallback.
